          "tag": "A Let's talk",
          "training": {
            "type": "listening_response",
            "promptZh": "约翰问萨拉「你好吗？」，萨拉很好，该怎么回答？",
            "options": [
              { "text": "Fine, thank you.", "correct": true },
              { "text": "Goodbye, John.", "correct": false },
              { "text": "This is Miss Jones.", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "别人问 How are you?（你好吗？），就说 Fine, thank you.（很好，谢谢）。两个错项一个是道别的话，一个是介绍别人的话，都对不上「你好吗」。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "A2",
          "question": { "en": "How are you?", "zh": "你好吗？" },
          "answer": null,
          "tag": "A Let's talk",
          "training": {
            "type": "sentence_choice",
            "promptZh": "用英语问「你好吗？」",
            "options": [
              { "text": "How are you?", "correct": true },
              { "text": "How you are?", "correct": false },
              { "text": "Are you how?", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "问「你好吗」的说法是 How are you?，are 放在 you 前面。一个错项把 are 和 you 写反了，一个把 are 提到最前面，顺序都不对。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "A3",
          "question": { "en": "Let's go to school.", "zh": "我们去上学吧。" },
          "answer": null,
          "tag": "A Let's talk",
          "training": {
            "type": "structure_transfer",
            "scenarioZh": "萨拉想叫约翰一起去上学。",
            "promptZh": "「我们去上学吧」用英语怎么说？",
            "options": [
              { "text": "Let's go to school.", "correct": true },
              { "text": "Let's school go to.", "correct": false },
              { "text": "Go to school let's.", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "招呼别人「一起去上学」用 Let's go to school.，Let's 放最前面，go to school 是「去上学」。两个错项都是把词的顺序弄乱了。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "A4",
          "question": { "en": "How are you?", "zh": "你好吗？" },
          "answer": null,
          "tag": "A 连一连",
          "training": {
            "type": "match",
            "promptZh": "把英文句和中文意思连起来。",
            "pairs": [
              { "en": "How are you?", "zh": "你好吗？" },
              { "en": "Fine, thank you.", "zh": "很好，谢谢。" },
              { "en": "Let's go to school.", "zh": "我们去上学吧。" }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "这几句都是见面问好、招呼上学的常用句，记住它们的中文意思。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B",
      "title": "认颜色 · Show me red",
      "description": "跟琼斯老师问好，听口令认颜色。",
