          "tag": "B Let's talk",
          "training": {
            "type": "listening_response",
            "promptZh": "老师介绍「早上好，这是琼斯老师」，你早上该怎么回应？",
            "options": [
              { "text": "Good morning, Miss Jones.", "correct": true },
              { "text": "Good afternoon, Miss Jones.", "correct": false },
              { "text": "Goodbye, Miss Jones.", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "早上见面回 Good morning（早上好）。一个错项 Good afternoon 是「下午好」，时间不对；一个 Goodbye 是「再见」，是分别时说的，都不合适。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B2",
          "question": { "en": "Show me red.", "zh": "给我看看红色。" },
          "answer": { "en": "OK.", "zh": "好的。" },
          "tag": "B Let's talk",
          "training": {
            "type": "fill_word",
            "promptZh": "「给我看看红色」该填哪个颜色？",
            "sentenceTemplate": "Show me ___.",
            "options": [
              { "text": "red", "correct": true },
              { "text": "green", "correct": false },
              { "text": "blue", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "red 是「红色」。green（绿色）、blue（蓝色）也是真实的颜色词，但意思不是红色，要按中文选 red。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B3",
          "question": { "en": "Show me red.", "zh": "给我看看红色。" },
          "answer": null,
          "tag": "B 连词成句",
          "training": {
            "type": "sentence_order",
            "promptZh": "把词块排成正确的句子：「给我看看红色」",
            "tokens": ["red.", "Show", "me"],
            "answer": ["Show", "me", "red."],
            "explanationZh": "请别人「给我看看……」用 Show + me + 颜色：Show me red.。这句没有可以挪位置的词，顺序只有一种。"
